== Trivia ==
* This item is used in {{chal|Darkness Falls}}.
* The item itself is a reference to the act of cutting one's self, usually at the wrists, to inflict self-harm or to commit suicide by loss of blood.
* Isaac's appearance after using the item is just like the {{E|Dople}}.
* In the original ''The Binding of Isaac'', Razor Blade was unlocked by defeating {{e|Mom's Heart}} / {{E|It Lives!}} as {{C|Eve}}.

